{"sourceUrl":"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:15.247931+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>工程硕博士培养改革专项以培养卓越工程师后备人才为目标</span><span>,</span><span>旨在调动高校和企业两个积极性，促进产学研深度融合，提高工程硕博士培养质量。专项聚焦国家重大战略需求</span><span>,</span><span>支撑产业链安全</span><span>,</span><span>着力打造一支政治坚定、爱党报国，理学基础理论功底扎实、工学专业技术能力和水平突出，具备较强工程技术创新创造能力</span><span>,</span><span>善于解决复杂工程技术难题，国际视野宽阔，扎根工程实践和生产一线的高水平工程师队伍。</span></p>\n<p><span>一、专项介绍</span></p>\n<p><span>江南大学作为工程硕博士培养改革专项试点高校，本次专项招生聚焦<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong>生物医药及高端医疗设备、新材料、人工智能</strong>三个领域，联合<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong>中国保利集团有限公司</strong>（以下简称</span><span>“</span><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>保利集团</span><span>”</span><span>）<strong>、<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>华<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>润（集团）有限公司</strong>（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>华润集团</span><span>”</span><span>）、<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>中国资源循环集团有限公司<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>（以下简称</span><span>“</span><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>中国资环</span><span>”</span><span>）</span><span>、<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>中粮集团有限公司（以下简称</span><span>“</span><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>中粮集团</span><span>”</span><span>）、<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>极氪汽车（上海）有限公司</span><span>（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>极氪</span><span>汽车</span><span>”</span><span>）按照专业领域分组进行选拔考核，择优录取，拟招收工程类<strong>专业学位硕士<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>研究生（硕士推免）、专业学位博士研究生（本科直博）</strong>，实际人数可根据招生计划、生源情况等动态调整。</span></p>\n<p><span>二、联培企业简介</span></p>\n<p><span>保利集团、华润集团、</span><span>中国资环、<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>中粮集团、<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>极氪汽车</span><span>能够提供充分的产业实践资源和市场渠道优势，与学校共育高水平工程技术人才。</span></p>\n<p><span>保利集团是经国务院、中央军委批准组建，由国务院国有资产监督管理委员会直接管理的大型中央企业。成立</span><span>40</span><span>年来，保利已形成</span><span>“</span><span>优化贸易、升级地产、做强文化、创新科技、做特工程、金融支撑</span><span>”</span><span>的</span><span>“5+1”</span><span>业务体系，成为业务范围涵盖衣食住行用和精神文化生活等方面的多元化企业集团。</span></p>\n<p><span>华润集团归属国务院国资委直接监管，被列为国有重点骨干企业。华润的啤酒、燃气、商业地产、制药和医疗等领域经营规模在行业位居前列，华润置地是中国内地实力雄厚的综合地产开发商之一，雪花、怡宝、万象城、</span><span>999</span><span>、双鹤、东阿阿胶、江中等是享誉全国的知名品牌。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>中国资环</span><span>是党中央着眼健全绿色低碳循环发展经济体系、全面推进美丽中国建设而决策组建的中央企业。</span><span>中国资环</span><span>依托现有产业优势，做优再生钢铁、做强再生纤维，并在重点区域加速布局动力电池、电子电器、新能源器件、有色金属、塑料等循环利用业务板块。</span></p>\n<p><span>中粮集团构建了覆盖跨国农粮收储、物流、加工、贸易的全产业链供应系统。集团聚焦粮、油、糖、棉等品类，布局南美、黑海、亚太、欧洲、非洲等消费市场，投资仓储设施、港口、码头、铁路、大型现代化散粮运输船队，建设农粮加工基地，建立起链接东西半球的农粮贸易大通道。</span></p>\n<p><span>极氪汽车为吉利控股集团旗下高端智能电动汽车品牌，基于</span><span> SEA </span><span>浩瀚架构开发整车，掌握</span><span>900V</span><span>高压平台、一体化压铸、自研三电等核心技术，坚持性能、安全、豪华的产品路线。极氪汽车融合传统车企制造功底与智能化创新能力，致力于面向全球提供高品质智能电动出行解决方案。</span></p>\n<p><span>三、专项培养特色</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong><span>实行</span></strong><strong><span>“</span></strong><strong><span>工学交替</span></strong><strong><span>”</span></strong><strong><span>项目制培养</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>本专项采用</span><span>“</span><span>工学交替</span><span>”</span><span>培养模式，硕士研究生原则上按</span><span>“1+2”</span><span>方式培养，即</span><span>1</span><span>年左右在学校学习，</span><span>2</span><span>年左右在企业实践；博士研究生原则上按</span><span>“2+3”</span><span>方式培养，即</span><span>2</span><span>年左右在学校学习，</span><span>3</span><span>年左右在企业实践。</span><span>“</span><span>工学交替</span><span>”</span><span>培养模式助力学生开展</span><span>“</span><span>真实践</span><span>”</span><span>、解决</span><span>“</span><span>真问题</span><span>”</span><span>、产出</span><span>“</span><span>真成果</span><span>”</span><span>，实现</span><span>“</span><span>真培养</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong><span>实施</span></strong><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong><span>实践成果</span></strong><strong><span>导向评价体系</span></strong><span>。<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>发表学术论文不再作为申请学位的唯一标准，可以实践成果申请学位，实践成果形式包括：省部级科技成果奖、自主研发设计产品或样机、发明专利、工程技术方案等。学位论文可采用重大工程设计，新产品研发，装备研制等形式。</span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong><span>提供</span></strong><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong><span>入企实践条件保障</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>入企实践期间</span><span>，联培企业提供研究用高水平仪器设备、科研项目津贴、商业保险、员工待遇的食宿条件等。毕业后，可优先入职联培企业。</span></p>\n<p><span>四、报名条件</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>1.</span><span>热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，拥护社会主义制度，遵纪守法，品德良好</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>具有所在高校推荐免试攻读研究生资格的</span><span>2027</span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>3.</span><span>报考<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>专业学位博士研究生（本科直博）的考生需由两位报考学科专业领域内的教授或相当专业技术职称的专家推荐。</span></p>\n<p><span>五、<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>招生工作安排</span></p>\n<p><span>1.<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> </span><span>预报名</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>12:00-9</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日</span><span>12:00</span><span>，申请人将《<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong>江南大学</strong></span><strong><span>2027</span></strong><strong><span>年工程硕博士<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>培养改革专项报名表</span></strong><span>》</span><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>（见附件</span><span>2</span><span>）</span><span>和加盖学校教务处或所在院系公章的<strong>本科阶段成绩单</strong>（含专业排名）提交至各招生学院，</span><span>申请<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>专业学位博士研究生（本科直博）的学生<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>须一并提交<a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong>专家推荐信</strong><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>（见附件</span><span>3</span><span>）</span><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>。</span><span>专项招生课题清单见附件</span><span>1</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>综合考核</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>考核实行<strong>差额</strong>面试，学校对申请者提交的所有材料进行审查，择优确定面试考核名单，通知申请人参加综合考核。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>13</span><span>日左右组织面试</span><span>，学校与联培企业设立考核组，对申请人所申报领域的基础理论知识、创新潜质、工程素养、兴趣意愿等方面进行考核。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日左右发布考核结果并公示</span><span>（未通过本专项考核的学生，如果符合条件，可继续申请其他推免招生）。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>3.</span><span>志愿填报及录取</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>考核通过且获得本科就读学校推荐免试资格者，须在</span><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span><span>登录</span><span>“</span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开管理服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（</span><a href=\"https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></a><span>，开通时间以中国研招网公告为准），按要求填报志愿。</span></p>\n<p><span>学校在国家推免系统中发放待录取通知，拟接收推免生应在规定时间内接受并确认。</span></p>\n<p><span>六、其他事项</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>本次为专项招生，学生一旦通过考核并确认接受拟录取结果，不得以任何理由放弃工程硕博士培养改革专项推免研究生名额，否则函告其被录用的国内外院校或单位。确认拟录取前请务必慎重考虑，确认后不能再做更改。</span></p>\n<p><span>七、联系方式</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>国家</span><span>卓越工程师学院联系方式</span></p>\n<p><span>联系人：丁老师</span><span>  </span><span>操老师</span><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>电话：</span><span>0510-85919066  </span><span>邮箱</span><span>: </span><span>zygcsxy@jiangnan.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>研究生院招生办公室联系方式</span></p>\n<p><span>  电话：</span><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>0510-</span><span>85197929 </span><span>邮箱</span><span>: yzb@jiangnan.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span>招生学院联系方式如下</span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong><span>序号</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>学院</span></strong><strong><span>/</span></strong><strong><span>部门</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span>电话邮箱</span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>1</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>食品学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>郑老师</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0510-</span><span>85912065</span></p><p><span>zhengyujiao@jiangnan.edu.cn</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>2</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>生物工程学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>孔老师</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0510-</span><span>85918517</span></p><p><span>biotech_yj@jiangnan.edu.cn</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>3</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>生命科学与健康工程学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>王老师</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0510-</span><span>85325209</span></p><p><span>8202206044@jiangnan.edu.cn</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>4</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>纺织科学与工程学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>沙老师</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>0510-85912011</span></p><p><span>178631162@163.com</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>5</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>化学与材料工程学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>虞老师</span></p></td>\n<td><p><a href=\"https://wxms.jiangnan.edu.cn/info/1092/5764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>0510-</span><span>85917071</span></p><p><span>                hgyjs@jiangnan.edu.cn</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>6</span></p></td>\n<td><p>